        "original_id": "588f9520-4f27-5f9b-b932-f2b228ad28d7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Colgate University, ECAC Hockey, Eastern College Athletic Conference\n- Teams: Colgate Raiders women's ice hockey, Boston University Terriers women's ice hockey\n- People: Shannon Doyle\n- Topics: NCAA Division I women's ice hockey\n\nFacts:\n- ECAC Hockey used to be affiliated with the Eastern College Athletic Conference, a consortium of over 300 colleges in the eastern United States.\n- From 2010 to 2012, Shannon Doyle accumulated 25 points with the Colgate Raiders women's ice hockey team at the NCAA level.\n- The Colgate Raiders women's ice hockey team represents Colgate University and competes in NCAA Division I ice hockey in ECAC Hockey.\n- From 2012 to 2015, Shannon Doyle accumulated 53 points with the Boston University Terriers women's ice hockey program over two seasons, missing the 2013–14 season due to injury.",
